'''Santa's Spirit''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that was originally obtainable by completing [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Christmas_Event_2020#Santa.27s_Challenge Saint Nikilis' Challenge] during the [[Christmas Event 2020|2020 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable though trading as the event has since ended. 

==Appearance==
Santa’s Spirit has a navy blue blade with a winter blue edge, along with a dark taped, gradient-like handle. The guard is navy blue, similarly to the blade.

==Trivia==
*Similarly to the previous years' [[Santa's Magic|Saint Nikilis’ Challenge]], you had to unbox/trade for 10 weapons to trade in for this knife.

